OL,3,GNEWSATrains to be reduced to help
OL,4,Aprotect tracks
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrains on a main rail route between the
OL,7,FEast Sussex coast and London will not
OL,8,Frun in off-peak hours for four weeks
OL,9,Fafter track conditions were affected by
OL,10,Fthe hot and dry weather over summer.
OL,12,FSouthern Rail says that no trains will
OL,13,Frun directly between Eastbourne/Ore and
OL,14,FLondon Victoria, via Lewes and Haywards
OL,15,FHeath, between 09:00 BST and 16:15 on
OL,16,FMondays through to Friday.
OL,18,FServices from Eastbourne will run
OL,19,Fhourly to and from Haywards Heath,
OL,20,Fwhere passengers can change for onward
OL,21,Fconnections to the capital, as well as
OL,22,FGatwick Airport.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
